exports[`theme baseline — dark > contrast report (snapshot) 1`] = `
"# Theme contrast — dark

Each role is measured against its own surface (default: \`colors.background\`).

| Role | Value | Surface | Ratio | Floor | Pass |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| foreground | #DCE0E8 | background | 13.67 | 4.5:1 | ✅ |
| axisText | #ACB2BE | background | 8.50 | 4.5:1 | ✅ |
| crosshairLabelText | #DCE0E8 | crosshairLabelBg | 11.00 | 4.5:1 | ✅ |
| tooltipText | #DCE0E8 | tooltipBg | 13.14 | 4.5:1 | ✅ |
| candleUpBody | #089981 | background | 5.07 | 3.0:1 | ✅ |
| candleDownBody | #f23645 | background | 4.64 | 3.0:1 | ✅ |
| performancePositive | #22D69B | background | 9.61 | 4.5:1 | ✅ |
| performanceNegative | #FF6464 | background | 6.25 | 4.5:1 | ✅ |
| performanceNeutral | #9AA0A6 | background | 6.85 | 4.5:1 | ✅ |
| candleDojiBorder | #8A8F98 | background | 5.57 | 3.0:1 | ✅ |
| crosshairLine | #686C72 | background | 3.43 | 3.0:1 | ✅ |
| selectionStroke | #4A9EFF | background | 6.57 | 3.0:1 | ✅ |
| alertActive | #4A9EFF | background | 6.57 | 3.0:1 | ✅ |
| alertTriggered | #FFA94D | background | 9.51 | 3.0:1 | ✅ |
| avwapLine | #A78BFA | background | 6.65 | 3.0:1 | ✅ |
| mtfOverlay | #38BDF8 | background | 8.45 | 3.0:1 | ✅ |

## Indicator palette

| Slot | Value | Ratio vs BG |
|---|---|---|
| i1 | #4A9EFF | 6.57 |
| i2 | #FFB95A | 10.63 |
| i3 | #22D69B | 9.61 |
